@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 11, 17 and 16 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.33.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.33.0> ; owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.32.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.33.0 (2026-11-25): Chapter 17 plain deck verified; the story is Done and the page build is Ready again."""@en .

ex:TK10_NoAnalogies_17_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Logs in 08-tooling/ch17-deck/logs_v4_0_0, read in full: deck standard 1.3.0 13 of 13; fit, layout (after the slide 7 fix), notes, overlap, reader notes and story prose all exit 0; material check 1.0.2 no failing condition; manifest self-check 2.1.0 pass (28 examples, each re-run alone in a fresh interpreter and all in order); word search of all slide text and notes for the analogy words used in the old deck and for like a, is like, everyday, think of, imagine: 0 hits (analogy_word_search.log). Story repeat check: the same 2 pairs to read as before, both outside chapter 17, none of chapter 17's six stories among the 22 shared-name lines. NOT DONE and stated: the generic code check needs a chapter source file and chapter 17 has none, so its C1 to C5 were not run (the self-check covers that the manifest equals the deck and each example runs alone); the deck was not looked at rendered; the Owner has not read the rewritten rows and notes; the rows' facts come from the chapter's own slides and were not re-run. The deck holds no install or operating-system text, so the Windows-default ruling has nothing to change in it." .
ex:ST10_NoAnalogies_17 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "All three tasks Done; the acceptance criterion holds for the deck, its notes and the manifest. Its lecture text belongs to the page stage, where it is made from this deck." .
ex:TK10_Page_17_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Ready ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Ready again on 2026-11-25: the plain deck 4.0.0 and manifest 1.2.0 are verified." .
